<title>CYPRUS: CYPRUS ACCEPTS WHEAT, CORN TENDERS.</title>
<headline>CYPRUS ACCEPTS WHEAT, CORN TENDERS.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Friday said it accepted a tender from Toepfer for 14,000 tonnes of spring wheat at $187.89 per tonne and 8,000 tonnes of durum wheat at $241.44.</p>
<p>It also accepted a tender from Amiga for the supply of 18,000 tonnes of corn at $126.95 per tonne.</p>
<p>The prices are C&amp;F. Shipment of both cargoes is scheduled in September.</p>
</text>
